                "text_iBeMCF": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>MAKE was created to bring home the kind of Japanese matcha traditionally prepared in tea ceremonies and tea houses. Produced in limited quantities, tea of this quality is not made for broad café distribution.<br/><br/>Matcha Maker in Residence is the exception.<br/><br/>For a season, we partner with a property we admire to bring MAKE onsite. Before it hits the menu, we train the team in how to traditionally prepare and serve it.</p><p>From there, each residency takes its own shape. There may be signature drinks, events, or special activations unique to the setting, but one thing remains the same: truly great matcha on the menu during the duration of the residency.</p>",
